OL,3,GNEWSACross bay walks threatened by
OL,4,A'tractor vandals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of Lancashire's
OL,7,Fhistorical cross bay walks have said
OL,8,Fvandals targeting vital safety
OL,9,Fequipment are threatening the future of
OL,10,Fthe nearly 500-year-old tradition.
OL,12,FThe Morecambe Bay walks - from Arnside
OL,13,Fto Grange - can involve up to 500
OL,14,Fpeople at a time and the bay is
OL,15,Fnotorious for quicksand, fast-rising
OL,16,Ftides and deep tidal channels, so
OL,17,Fguides use tractors as mobile rescue
OL,18,Fand support vehicles.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
