OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACross bay walks threatened by
OL,4,A'tractor vandals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Hales, secretary of the Guide over
OL,7,FSands Trust, said in the last most
OL,8,Fserious incident, attackers started one
OL,9,Fof the tractors they use, leaving it to
OL,10,Frun dry so the engine seized.
OL,12,F"The reality is without the tractors we
OL,13,Fcannot do the walks," she said,
OL,14,F"they're a safety net for the walkers."
